{"id":"vod_hh_118637","vodId":"118637","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"弹丸论破3（未来篇）","name_cn":"弹丸论破3（未来篇）","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/ffe1461583e29a3faede6bc99000ad0f.jpg"},"summary":"在“超高校级的绝望”带来的“人类史上最大最恶的绝望事件”之下，世界陷入了濒临崩坏的绝境。为了拯救这个充满绝望的世界，“未来机关”由原希望峰学园的校长与师生们集结而成了。其中就包括了曾经打倒了江之岛盾子的苗木诚等78期生。他们在此继续复兴世界的活动，但苗木却被以 庇护“绝望的残党”这一罪名遭到了众人的怀疑。未来机关众人为了苗木的处分而聚集在一起时，却遭到黑白熊的监禁，并被要求进行“最后的自相残杀”。他们的手臂被戴上了奇妙的手环，过了一定时间就会被投以安眠药。不止如此，这其中还存在着“背叛者”，是为了杀掉未来","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-01-17 20:30:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aM88pNPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwppB2ge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eVOOBoBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b2kk52jd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/en55p7Yd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bDkk56Aa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b8225K2e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYYnE7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkkwVWa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYYnEVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADD5Kpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aKrrn9Je/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:01.102Z"}